&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Celonis is the trusted platform to industrialize Enterprise AI. At our core is the Celonis Context Model — which combines process data, business knowledge, and intelligence into a living digital twin of the enterprise that AI can actually understand, turning AI&#39;s operational blind spots into operational clarity. World&#39;s leading companies trust Celonis and its global ecosystem of partners to make their AI agents, people, systems, and processes work together, achieving transformational outcomes. We believe there&#39;s a massive opportunity to unlock global productivity and sustainability by giving AI the context to understand how every business process really works. Join our mission to make processes work for people, companies, and the planet.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Applied Value Engineer you push the envelope in solving mission-critical problems for our customers. You will work with our most strategic customers, understand their strategy and key challenges, and build Celonis solutions using cutting-edge AI technologies from market leaders such as Microsoft and OpenAI. With Celonis’ market-leading Process Intelligence (PI) Platform we feed operational context to AI so it understands our customers’ businesses and enables them to industrialize AI unlocking real ROI on AI deployments and at scale. There is no AI without PI. You will prototype these solutions, demonstrate their value to executives, and ensure successful implementation, adoption and value realization to increase Celonis&#39; footprint at those customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Senior Applied Value Engineer, you are a strategic pioneer leading the charge in solving complex, business-critical problems for our customers. Working with our most strategic global accounts, you will diagnose their strategy and key operational challenges to &lt;strong&gt;discover and build tailored, domain-specific use cases&lt;/strong&gt;. You will architect and prototype &lt;strong&gt;state-of-the-art AI and technical solutions&lt;/strong&gt; on the Celonis platform, demonstrate their business impact to C-suite Executives, and ensure successful implementation, adoption, and value realization.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Native-level German proficiency (C1/C2) is required for this role. Candidates must be able to lead customer workshops, conduct executive presentations, and manage stakeholder interactions in German.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The work you’ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Discovery &amp;amp; Advanced AI Solutioning:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as the foremost Celonis product and domain positioning expert. Seamlessly translate deep domain expertise and complex customer requirements into flawless enterprise architecture. You will lead technical discovery to architect, prototype, and build bespoke, state-of-the-art AI solutions targeting nuanced operational pain points.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Solution Development:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead the end-to-end execution of high-stakes Proof-of-Value (PoV) projects. Architect and deliver highly secure, scalable LLM/agent systems with advanced RAG, tools, and strict guardrails; integrating flawlessly with rigid enterprise data, identity, and compliance frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Value Selling &amp;amp; Realization:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as a trusted advisor, maintaining active involvement with strategic accounts to ensure programmatic value realization until agreed-upon value, massive adoption thresholds, and operational transformations are achieved.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Domain &amp;amp; Industry Specialization:&lt;/strong&gt; Leverage deep domain expertise combined with cross-system, AI-driven solutioning to architect industry-specific E2E solutions. You will codify this work into reusable methodology and globally scalable assets to accelerate time-to-value and mentor junior peers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The qualifications you need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive-Facing Presales &amp;amp; Value Engineering (5+ years):&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated experience independently owning the technical close and driving compelling AI transformation narratives. Requires a proven background in accountable PoV execution, complex ROI/TCO modeling, and showcasing the &quot;Art of the Possible&quot; by pitching visionary solutions to hidden problems—with a clear track record of driving projects all the way through to achieved value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Domain &amp;amp; Industry Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Comprehensive knowledge of core operational workflows and industry landscapes (e.g., supply chain, finance). You can speak the language of C-suite executives and seamlessly connect complex, systemic bottlenecks to strategic AI solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Software/Data Engineering: &lt;/strong&gt;Python proficiency, modular API design, creating reusable libraries, advanced SQL, and scalable data integration using ML/AI frameworks (PyTorch, TensorFlow, scikit-learn, XGBoost, Hugging Face).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong presentation skills&lt;/strong&gt; to both internal and external stakeholders (including executives), whether whiteboarding sessions or formal readouts and demos.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Degree:&lt;/strong&gt; Masters Degree in computer science, engineering, mathematics or related fields, or equivalent work experience preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Native-level or near-native German language skills (C1/C2), with the ability to confidently engage German-speaking customers, facilitate workshops, and present to executive stakeholders.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Celonis can offer you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Pioneer Innovation:&lt;/span&gt; Work with the global leader in Process Mining and the Process Intelligence Graph to shape the future of AI-driven business operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Ownership from Day 1:&lt;/span&gt; Every full-time &quot;Celonaut&quot; is an owner, receiving Restricted Stock Units (RSUs) and merit-based refresh grants.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Unrivaled Family Support:&lt;/span&gt; Benefit from our inclusive parental leave policy—24 weeks of fully paid leave for primary carers and 12 weeks for supporting carers, available from your first day of employment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Work-Life Integration:&lt;/span&gt; Enjoy Unlimited PTO (in applicable regions) and generous PTO globally, as well as a flexible hybrid work model that balances remote focus with vibrant office collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Continuous Growth:&lt;/span&gt; Elevate your skills through our 70-20-10 learning framework, mentorship programs, and access to a dedicated learning platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Holistic Well-being:&lt;/span&gt; Prioritize your health with subsidized Wellhub memberships, mental health counseling, and dedicated &quot;Wellness Weeks&quot; that prioritize work/life balance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Drive Sustainability:&lt;/span&gt; Participate in annual Impact Days, where you receive paid time off to volunteer for community and environmental causes with your local office, or virtually.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Global Inclusion &amp;amp; Belonging:&lt;/span&gt; Find community through our Inclusion Think Tank and participate in our annual Inclusion Days, ensuring every voice is heard and valued.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Value-Driven Impact:&lt;/span&gt; Join a mission-led organization where our core values—Live for Customer Value, The Best Team Wins, We Own It, and Earth Is Our Future—drive every decision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1264&quot;&gt;Celonis is the trusted platform to industrialize Enterprise AI, empowering organizations to analyze, design, and operate AI-driven processes. The Celonis Platform is powered by the Celonis Context Model, which combines process data, business knowledge, and intelligence to create a living digital twin of the enterprise that AI can understand — turning AI’s operational blind spots into operational clarity. Industry-leading companies around the world trust Celonis and its global ecosystem of partners to make their AI agents, people, systems, and processes work together, achieving transformational outcomes. Celonis is headquartered in Munich, Germany, and New York City, USA, with more than 20 offices worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1982&quot;&gt;Get familiar with the Celonis Process Intelligence Platform by watching this &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _ect4ttxp _2rkolb4i _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YR5oRJGhJYg&amp;amp;list=PLuVor-ZUD4pnM6G33C5D0tjXUvlTPYBRe&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;video&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Celonis Inclusion Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Celonis, we believe our people make us who we are and that “The Best Team Wins”. We know that the best teams are made up of people who bring different perspectives to the table. And when everyone feels included, able to speak up and knows their voice is heard - that&#39;s when creativity and innovation happen.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Privacy:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Any information you submit to Celonis as part of your application will be processed in accordance with Celonis’ &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/candidate-notices&quot;&gt;Accessibility and Candidate Notices&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By submitting this application, you confirm that you agree to the storing and processing of your personal data by Celonis as described in our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/privacy-notice/&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice for the Application and Hiring Process&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Use of Artificial Intelligence Tools&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We rely on an artificial intelligence tool to match the information from your resume to the relevant Celonis job descriptions. This processing is limited to the information provided in your resume or in your candidate profile. The tool produces a match score per candidate for a role, suggests preliminary ranking, and provides recommendations.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The tool is only used for support in parts of the job application process, including to facilitate the identification of the relevant Celonis Jobs for candidates and recruiters. All final decisions are made by hiring managers and the Celonis talent acquisition team. Hiring managers and HR specialists use this tool responsibly, are aware of the risk of potential bias, and are equipped to mitigate it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please be aware of common job offer scams, impersonators and frauds. Learn more &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/fraud-alert/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Anthropic&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Anthropic’s mission is to create reliable, interpretable, and steerable AI systems. We want AI to be safe and beneficial for our users and for society as a whole. Our team is a quickly growing group of committed researchers, engineers, policy experts, and business leaders working together to build beneficial AI systems.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;À propos du poste&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ce poste de direction est essentiel : il consiste à construire et à faire passer à l’échelle les partenariats d’Anthropic avec les cabinets de conseil, les intégrateurs de systèmes mondiaux (GSI) et les boutiques partenaires nativement IA en France.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vous travaillerez en étroite collaboration avec l’équipe commerciale pour que les clients adoptent l’IA grâce à nos partenaires.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ce poste est un poste de construction, et non de gestion. Compte tenu du stade de développement d’Anthropic, nous recherchons un profil qui a déjà fait ses preuves en faisant passer des partenariats de zéro à des moteurs de revenus à grande échelle, un profil qui a bâti ces relations de A à Z, et non simplement hérité de relations existantes pour les gérer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsabilités&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partenariats et exécution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous collaborerez étroitement avec l’équipe commerciale pour comprendre comment les partenaires peuvent soutenir l’adoption de Claude par les clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous accompagnerez les partenaires dans la création de solutions clients reproductibles, répondant à des cas d’usage précis dans de nombreux secteurs : services financiers, santé, distribution, industrie, secteur public et services professionnels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Performance et pilotage des indicateurs clés (KPI)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous portez la responsabilité des indicateurs clés de performance et vous les pilotez : revenus influencés par les partenaires, livraison réalisée par les partenaires, nombre de personnes consultantes formées et certifiées.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Chaque deal influencé par votre portefeuille de partenaires doit être conçu pour la réussite du client et la croissance de sa valeur à long terme. Vous définirez des critères de réussite pour les comptes communs, veillerez à la qualité de la mise en œuvre et de l’accompagnement à l’adoption, et mettrez en place des boucles de retour d’expérience favorisant l’amélioration continue.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous rendrez compte de la santé des partenariats, de leur avancement et de leurs résultats commerciaux, en vous appuyant sur des analyses fondées sur les données.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Développement du marché et construction de la marque&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous renforcerez la notoriété de la marque Anthropic en France grâce à des relations stratégiques avec les partenaires.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous élaborerez et déploierez des stratégies de mise sur le marché (GTM) propres à chaque marché, adaptées aux pratiques commerciales et aux nuances culturelles locales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous composerez avec les enjeux locaux de réglementation, de conformité et de souveraineté des données.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous créerez un avantage concurrentiel grâce aux capacités singulières des partenaires et à des propositions de valeur élaborées en commun.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Votre profil&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ce poste pourrait vous convenir si vous réunissez les atouts suivants :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous avez l’esprit d’initiative et le goût de construire : vous êtes à l’aise pour partir de zéro et créer des partenariats d’envergure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous maîtrisez l’anglais et le français.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous comptez au moins 8 ans d’expérience dans les partenariats technologiques à destination des entreprises, idéalement dans le cloud, l’IA/ML ou les activités de plateforme.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous avez une culture de la donnée, tournée vers les résultats mesurables et l’atteinte des KPI, et un historique avéré de revenus additionnels générés grâce aux partenariats dans la région.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous avez démontré votre capacité à assurer la réussite des clients et la protection de la marque via les canaux partenaires.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous avez l’esprit de compétition : la victoire et la différenciation sont votre moteur.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous avez une approche collaborative et savez travailler de façon transversale avec les équipes commerciales, produit, marketing et régionales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous nourrissez une vraie passion pour l’IA et vous vous reconnaissez dans la mission d’Anthropic : développer une IA bénéfique.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Relations de travail&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Votre rattachement hiérarchique se fera auprès de la direction des partenariats internationaux, tandis que votre activité quotidienne sera pilotée par la personne responsable des partenariats EMEA Sud. Vous travaillerez également en étroite collaboration avec la direction commerciale régionale d’Anthropic et ses Account Executives, ainsi qu’avec les équipes Customer Success et Applied AI de la région.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lieu et déplacements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ce poste est basé à Paris, en France, avec des déplacements à prévoir pour rencontrer les partenaires et les clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About the Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a critical leadership role responsible for building and scaling Anthropic&#39;s consulting, GSIs and AI-native boutique partners in France.&lt;br&gt;You will be working closely with the sales team to make sure customers are adopting AI through our partners.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This is a builder role, not a manager role.&lt;/strong&gt; Given Anthropic&#39;s stage, we need someone who has proven they can take partnerships from zero to scaled revenue engines — someone who has built these relationships from the ground up, not just inherited and managed existing ones.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partnerships and execution:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will engage closely with the sales team to understand how partners can support customer Claude adoption&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will guide partners in creating repeatable customer solutions that address specific use cases across industries including financial services, healthcare, retail, manufacturing, public sector, and professional services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Performance and KPI ownership:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and drive key performance indicators, partner-influenced revenue, partner delivery, consultants trained and certified&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Every deal influenced through your partner portfolio must be architected for customer success and long-term value expansion. You will establish success criteria for joint accounts, ensure proper implementation and adoption support, and create feedback loops that drive continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Report on partnership health, progress, and commercial outcomes with data-driven insights&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Market Development &amp;amp; Brand Building&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Amplify the Anthropic brand in France strategic partner relationships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute market-specific GTM strategies adapted to local business practices and cultural nuances&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Navigate local regulatory, compliance, and data sovereignty considerations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create competitive differentiation through unique partner capabilities and joint value propositions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You may be a good fit if you have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Builder mentality — comfortable starting from zero and creating scaled partnerships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Fluent in English and French&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of experience in enterprise technology partnerships, ideally within cloud, AI/ML, or platform businesses&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data-driven mindset with focus on measurable outcomes and KPI attainment. Track record of driving incremental revenues through partnerships in the region&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;History of delivering exceptional customer success and brand protection through partner channels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive drive — obsessed with winning and creating differentiation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative approach with ability to work cross-functionally across sales, product, marketing, and regional teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for AI and alignment with Anthropic&#39;s mission of beneficial AI development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working Relationships&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will formally report to the International Partnerships leader, while your day-to-day work will be led by our South EMEA Partnerships lead. You will also partner closely with Anthropic&#39;s regional sales leader and their Account Executives, as well as the in-region Customer Success and Applied AI teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location and Travel&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role will be based in Paris, France with travel expected to engage with partners and customers externally.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The annual compensation range for this role is listed below.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For sales roles, the range provided is the role’s On Target Earnings (&quot;OTE&quot;) range, meaning that the range includes both the sales commissions/sales bonuses target and annual base salary for the role.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Annual Salary:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€220.000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€260.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Logistics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum education: &lt;/strong&gt;Bachelor’s degree or an equivalent combination of education, training, and/or experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required field of study:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;A field relevant to the role as demonstrated through coursework, training, or professional experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum years of experience: &lt;/strong&gt;Years of experience required will correlate with the internal job level requirements for the position&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location-based hybrid policy:&lt;/strong&gt; Currently, we expect all staff to be in one of our offices at least 25% of the time. However, some roles may require more time in our offices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Visa sponsorship:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We do sponsor visas! However, we aren&#39;t able to successfully sponsor visas for every role and every candidate. But if we make you an offer, we will make every reasonable effort to get you a visa, and we retain an immigration lawyer to help with this.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;For roles performing work in California: &lt;/strong&gt;We will consider for employment all qualified applicants, including those with arrest or conviction records or criminal histories, in a manner consistent with the requirements of applicable state and local laws, including the San Francisco Fair Chance Ordinance, the City of Los Angeles’ Fair Chance Initiative for Hiring Ordinance, the Los Angeles County Fair Chance Ordinance for Employers, and the California Fair Chance Act.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We encourage you to apply even if you do not believe you meet every single qualification.&lt;/strong&gt; Not all strong candidates will meet every single qualification as listed.&amp;nbsp; Research shows that people who identify as being from underrepresented groups are more prone to experiencing imposter syndrome and doubting the strength of their candidacy, so we urge you not to exclude yourself prematurely and to submit an application if you&#39;re interested in this work. We think AI systems like the ones we&#39;re building have enormous social and ethical implications. We think this makes representation even more important, and we strive to include a range of diverse perspectives on our team.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Your safety matters to us.&lt;/strong&gt; To protect yourself from potential scams, remember that Anthropic recruiters only contact you ----- addresses. In some cases, we may partner with vetted recruiting agencies who will identify themselves as working on behalf of Anthropic. Be cautious of emails from other domains. Legitimate Anthropic recruiters will never ask for money, fees, or banking information before your first day. If you&#39;re ever unsure about a communication, don&#39;t click any links—visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;u data-stringify-type=&quot;underline&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--underline&quot; href=&quot;http://anthropic.com/careers&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;http://anthropic.com/careers&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot; data-remove-tab-index=&quot;true&quot;&gt;anthropic.com/careers&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&amp;nbsp;directly for confirmed position openings.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How we&#39;re different&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe that the highest-impact AI research will be big science. At Anthropic we work as a single cohesive team on just a few large-scale research efforts. And we value impact — advancing our long-term goals of steerable, trustworthy AI — rather than work on smaller and more specific puzzles. We view AI research as an empirical science, which has as much in common with physics and biology as with traditional efforts in computer science. We&#39;re an extremely collaborative group, and we host frequent research discussions to ensure that we are pursuing the highest-impact work at any given time. As such, we greatly value communication skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The easiest way to understand our research directions is to read our recent research. This research continues many of the directions our team worked on prior to Anthropic, including: GPT-3, Circuit-Based Interpretability, Multimodal Neurons, Scaling Laws, AI &amp;amp; Compute, Concrete Problems in AI Safety, and Learning from Human Preferences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come work with us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Anthropic is a public benefit corporation headquartered in San Francisco. We offer competitive compensation and benefits, optional equity donation matching, generous vacation and parental leave, flexible working hours, and a lovely office space in which to collaborate with colleagues. &lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Guidance on Candidates&#39; AI Usage:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Learn about&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.anthropic.com/candidate-ai-guidance&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.anthropic.com/candidate-ai-guidance&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;our policy&lt;/a&gt; for using AI in our application process.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Onsite Role - Office First&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team description&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As part of the Platform tribe, we&#39;re building a self-service, AI-ready &lt;strong&gt;Data Platform&lt;/strong&gt; that powers SumUp&#39;s next big bets: data, AI, and real-time analytics. Our team designs and runs the infrastructure that lets data engineers, analysts, and ML teams across the business ship reliable pipelines and products without reinventing the wheel each time. This role sits at the centre of that work, giving you a genuine chance to shape how thousands of SumUppers build with data every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and evolve the data platform&#39;s infrastructure (Terraform, Kubernetes, GCP), so every environment is reproducible, version-controlled, and auditable&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take end-to-end ownership of the reliability, performance, and scalability of the Data and AI platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop self-service features, including for ETL and orchestration, so teams can move faster without bespoke integrations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Automate operations to keep the platform highly available and cost-efficient as demand grows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate emerging technologies and shape adoption strategies that improve platform capabilities and business outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with product, infrastructure, data engineering, analytics, and AI/ML teams to make the standard path easier and safer than one-off integrations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;ll be great for this role if…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;More than 4 years of experience building &lt;strong&gt;internal platforms&lt;/strong&gt; consumed by other teams, in a Data, Platform, or Software Engineering role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong software engineering background in&lt;strong&gt; Python or Go&lt;/strong&gt;, along with solid SQL skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on knowledge of infrastructure and containerisation, such as&lt;strong&gt; Terraform,&lt;/strong&gt; Helm, Docker, and &lt;strong&gt;Kubernetes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort working with observability, monitoring, alerting, and platform reliability engineering practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in modern data stack (dbt, Snowflake, Trino, Airflow, etc.)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of setting up SDLC practices for analytics teams, including Git workflows, CI/CD, testing, and documentation standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;It&#39;s OK if you don&#39;t meet 100% of these criteria. If you&#39;re missing a few, it just means you&#39;ll have room to learn and grow with us.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Real-time streaming experience (e.g. Kafka, Flink, StarRocks, Pinot, Druid, ClickHouse)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with systems at petabyte scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience implementing AI-enabled systems, such as agentic SRE or AI automation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why you should join SumUp&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌎 Opportunity to work with SumUppers globally on large-scale fintech products used by millions of businesses worldwide, from our Berlin office. This involves an office-first setup&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌈 Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion: be part of a workplace that values and promotes diversity, fostering an inclusive environment where everyone&#39;s perspectives are respected and embraced&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🚀 Enrolment onto our Virtual Stock Option programme: you will own a stake in SumUp&#39;s future success&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📚 A dedicated annual L&amp;amp;D budget of €2000 for your individual development, which can be used to attend conferences and/or advance your career through further education&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💶 A corporate pension scheme where we match up to 20% of your contributions&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🏖 Generous time off: enjoy 28 days of paid leave plus public holidays and special leave days Numerous other benefits such as Urban Sports Club subsidy, Kita placement assistance, subsidised office lunches&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌴 Break4me: 1-month sabbatical after 3 years of service 🔗 Referral Bonus: earn additional rewards by referring talented individuals to join the SumUp team&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About SumUp&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Be empowered to do more that matters.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At SumUp, we&#39;re on a mission to empower small businesses across the globe by providing simple and affordable tools that allow them to thrive. Today, over 4 million businesses in 38 markets rely on SumUp as their financial partner to manage payments, finance and customer relationships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our commitment to small businesses is reflected in&lt;a href=&quot;https://youtu.be/9DG64C3moeQ?si=YpcWuBNBTOQPzeLI&quot;&gt; our diverse team&lt;/a&gt; of over 3,000 SumUppers from over 90 nationalities, united by global collaboration and an innovative mindset.&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.sumup.com/careers/culture/&quot;&gt; Our core values&lt;/a&gt; shape who we are and what we stand for, shaping our work culture and driving our success. We foster inclusivity and a continuous learning culture, providing a safe space for personal and professional growth. Our differences make us unique and strong as we strive to create an environment where everyone belongs and feels supported, no matter how they identify.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SumUp is proud to be an Equal Employment Opportunity employer, actively seeking and embracing diversity in our workforce. We don&#39;t make hiring or employment decisions based on race, colour, religion or religious belief, ethnic or national origin, nationality, sex, gender, gender identity, sexual orientation, disability, age or any other basis protected by applicable laws or prohibited by company policy. Our commitment extends beyond recruitment to creating a safe and respectful workplace where harassment of any form is strictly prohibited. Discover more about our culture and opportunities on our&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.sumup.com/careers/&quot;&gt; careers website&lt;/a&gt;, and follow our journey on&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/sumup/&quot;&gt; LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;,&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/insidesumup/&quot;&gt; Instagram&lt;/a&gt;, and&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.tiktok.com/@insidesumup&quot;&gt; TikTok&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📽 Want to add a video or LinkedIn post to accompany this job ad? Check out the&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.notion.so/sumup/Global-Employer-Brand-video-library-Empowering-Talent-Acquisition-partners-and-hiring-managers-194d3d97eb3c4eaca7ee2edff1a9d3fd&quot;&gt; Global Employer Brand video library&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Application Tip&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We recognise that candidates feel they need to meet 100% of the job criteria in order to apply for a job. Please note that this is only a guide. If you don’t tick every box, it’s ok too because it means you have room to learn and develop your career at SumUp.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About IonQ:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2F&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=IonQ%2C+Inc&amp;amp;index=7&amp;amp;md5=0818ffbedc6dbad8c4d1611ac94c2a0f&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;IonQ, Inc&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;. [NYSE: IONQ] is the world’s leading quantum platform and merchant supplier - delivering integrated quantum solutions across computing, networking, sensing, and security. IonQ’s newest generation of quantum computers, the IonQ Tempo, is the latest in a line of cutting-edge systems that have been helping customers and partners including &lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2Fnews%2Fionq-speeds-quantum-accelerated-drug-development-application-with&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=Amazon+Web+Services%2C&amp;amp;index=8&amp;amp;md5=a7f94ee9b71a392dca3cd6c413722e51&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Amazon Web Services, &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2Fnews%2Fionq-speeds-quantum-accelerated-drug-development-application-with&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=and&amp;amp;index=9&amp;amp;md5=2bed627b388878763f41ffe0e4edb16c&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;and &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2Fnews%2Fionq-speeds-quantum-accelerated-drug-development-application-with&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=AstraZeneca&amp;amp;index=10&amp;amp;md5=757c1f2c2ec94cf3982700106122164f&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;AstraZeneca&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt; achieve 20x performance results and accelerate innovation in drug discovery, materials science, financial modeling, logistics, cybersecurity, and defense. In 2025, the company achieved 99.99% two-qubit gate fidelity, &lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2Fnews%2Fionq-achieves-landmark-result-setting-new-world-record-in-quantum-computing&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=setting+a+world+record+in+quantum+computing+performance&amp;amp;index=11&amp;amp;md5=32e9cb88afbd439026a352666cc72c91&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;setting a world record in quantum computing performance&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Headquartered in College Park, Maryland, IonQ has operations in California, Colorado, Massachusetts, Tennessee, Washington, Italy, South Korea, Sweden, Switzerland, Canada, and the United Kingdom. Our quantum computing services are available through all major cloud providers, while we also meet the needs of networking and sensing customers across land, sea, air, and space. IonQ is making quantum platforms more accessible and impactful than ever before. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Role Overview&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Role:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;IonQ is hiring a Senior Quantum Sales Director to drive new and expansion revenue for Capella Data as a Service (DaaS) and satellite systems across EMEA. You will own a portfolio of strategic enterprise, defence and government accounts, selling SAR imagery and analytics subscriptions, tasking capacity and complete satellite systems, and you will report to Garrick Ballantine.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a quota carrying, hunter oriented role for a seller who can run long cycle capital programmes alongside faster moving data subscriptions, and who can translate space based sensing into mission and business outcomes. The role is remote, employed through an IonQ entity in the UK (Oxford) or Switzerland, with travel of up to 20%.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will own an annual new business and expansion quota across Capella DaaS subscriptions, tasking capacity and satellite system sales within an assigned enterprise, defence and civil government territory in EMEA. You will build and execute account plans for a named portfolio, mapping stakeholders across mission, programme, procurement and technical functions and building executive relationships at several levels in each account.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will sell the full value chain, from SAR data and analytics subscriptions and recurring tasking commitments to ground segment integration and dedicated or jointly owned satellite systems. Working with product, engineering and mission solutions teams, you will bring customer requirements back into the roadmap and represent IonQ at industry, defence and geospatial conferences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Key responsibilities include:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run complex, consultative sales cycles from prospecting through to close, including discovery, technical validation with solutions engineering, pricing, contracting and negotiation of subscription and system purchase agreements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Respond to RFIs, RFPs and government tenders in partnership with capture, proposal and contracts teams, and support prime and subcontractor teaming strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Forecast accurately in CRM, keep disciplined pipeline hygiene and deliver reliable monthly and quarterly commits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop executive relationships across mission, programme, procurement and technical stakeholders in each account.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent IonQ at industry, defence and geospatial events across EMEA, and feed customer requirements back to product and engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Requirements:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will bring substantial enterprise sales experience in geospatial data, earth observation, satellite systems, defence technology or adjacent data and SaaS markets, with a consistent record of exceeding quota. You will have closed both recurring data or subscription contracts and large capital or programme based hardware sales, and you will have sold to EMEA and allied government, defence and security customers, with a working knowledge of their procurement frameworks and contracting cycles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will have command of a structured sales methodology such as MEDDICC or Challenger, with disciplined CRM and forecasting rigour, and the ability to engage credibly with technical and mission stakeholders on remote sensing, SAR, tasking and data delivery workflows. A bachelor&#39;s degree in business, engineering or a related field, and willingness to travel up to 20%, are also required.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;You’d be a great fit with:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct experience selling SAR, optical imagery or RF sensing data and analytics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A background in satellite systems, ground segment or space mission integration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in early market development or category creation for an emerging technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to obtain the relevant national security clearance in your country of employment, such as UK SC or NATO clearance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Established relationships with EMEA government, defence or security customers, including NATO and allied programmes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The total compensation package includes base salary, bonus, equity, and a range of benefits available on our career site.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Compensation will vary based on individual factors such as education, qualifications, and experience of the final candidate(s), specific office location, and calibration against relevant market data and internal team equity. Posted base salary figures are subject to change as new market data becomes available. Our benefits include comprehensive medical, dental, and vision plans, matching 401(k), unlimited PTO and paid holidays, parental/adoption leave, legal insurance, and a home technology stipend. Details of participation in these benefit plans will be provided when a candidate receives an offer of employment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At IonQ, we believe in fair treatment, access, opportunity, and advancement for all while striving to identify and eliminate barriers. We empower employees to thrive by fostering a culture of autonomy, productivity, and respect. We are dedicated to creating an environment where individuals can feel welcomed, respected, supported, and valued.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;We are committed to equity and justice. We welcome different voices and viewpoints and do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, ancestry, physical and/or mental disability, medical condition, genetic information, marital status, sex, gender, gender identity, gender expression, transgender status, age, sexual orientation, military or veteran status, or any other basis protected by law. We are proud to be an Equal Employment Opportunity employer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;US Technical Jobs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;The position you are applying for will require access to technology that is subject to U.S. export control and government contract restrictions.&amp;nbsp; Employment with IonQ is contingent on either verifying “U.S. Person” (e.g., U.S. citizen, U.S. national, U.S. permanent resident, or lawfully admitted into the U.S. as a refugee or granted asylum) status for export controls and government contracts work, obtaining any necessary license, and/or confirming the availability of a license exception under U.S. export controls.&amp;nbsp; Please note that in the absence of confirming you are a U.S. Person for export control and government contracts work purposes, IonQ may choose not to apply for a license or decline to use a license exception (if available) for you to access export-controlled technology that may require authorization, and similarly, you may not qualify for government contracts work that requires U.S. Persons, and IonQ may decline to proceed with your application on those bases alone.&amp;nbsp; Accordingly, we will have some additional questions regarding your immigration status that will be used for export control and compliance purposes, and the answers will be reviewed by compliance personnel to ensure compliance with federal law.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;US Non-Technical Jobs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Due to applicable export control laws and regulations, candidates must be a U.S. citizen or national, U.S. permanent resident (i.e., current Green Card holder), or lawfully admitted into the U.S. as a refugee or granted asylum. Accordingly, we will have some additional questions regarding your immigration status that will be used for export control and compliance purposes, and the answers will be reviewed by compliance personnel to ensure compliance with federal law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you are interested in being a part of our team and mission, we encourage you to apply!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch">Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kurz und knapp&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Du kommst frisch aus dem Studium und bist bereit, direkt ins Herz unseres Businesses einzusteigen? Komplexe Challenges schrecken dich nicht ab - sondern motivieren dich erst recht? Dann gehörst du ins Consumer Team von Picnic. Unser 1-jähriges Trainee Programm ist kein Warm-up, sondern dein echtes Launchpad. Du startest direkt ohne Rotation in einer Consumer-Rolle - ob Category Management, Store, Meals oder Customer, je nachdem wo deine Stärken und Interessen liegen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ab Tag eins arbeitest du mit echten Daten, übernimmst Verantwortung und treibst Projekte voran, die sichtbar Impact haben. Parallel dazu investieren wir gezielt in dich: mit Trainings zu Marktverständnis, Business-Knowledge und Präsentations-Skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Und weil Erfolg gemeinsam mehr Spaß macht, wirst du Teil einer eng vernetzten Graduate-Community - smart, ambitioniert und immer bereit, Dinge neu zu denken.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Kurz gesagt: Wenn du nicht nur mitlaufen, sondern deinen Berufseinstieg aktiv mitgestalten willst - Welcome to Picnic!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Das erwartet dich&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Teamwork:&lt;/strong&gt; Gemeinsam mit unseren Category Managern, Designern, Copywritern und Tech-Teams bringst du alle Köpfe an einen Tisch. Das Ergebnis: ein App-Erlebnis, das nicht nur reibungslos funktioniert, sondern unsere Kunden begeistert.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analyse:&lt;/strong&gt; Zahlen sind dein Kompass. Aus Kundenverhalten leitest du smarte Insights ab, verbesserst App-Features, schärfst unser Pricing und entwickelst Aktionen, die einfach überzeugen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovation&lt;/strong&gt;: Du denkst einen Schritt weiter. Trends und Kundenbedürfnisse erkennst du früh und sorgst dafür, dass sich unser Sortiment ständig weiterentwickelt.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Optimierung:&lt;/strong&gt; Mit einem Blick fürs Detail entwickelst du Tools und Prozesse, die unsere kommerziellen Aktivitäten effizienter, präziser und wirkungsvoller machen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Projekte:&lt;/strong&gt; Du steuerst cross-funktionale Projekte - von Marketing über Customer Experience bis hin zu Operational Excellence. Immer mit dem Ziel, Wachstum voranzutreiben und echten Mehrwert für unsere Kunden zu schaffen.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Das bringst du mit&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ein erfolgreich abgeschlossenes Masterstudium im MINT-Bereich (z.B. Ingenieurwesen, Physik, Mathematik, Ökonometrie) oder im Bereich Wirtschaftswissenschaften (z. B. Wirtschaft, Finanzen, Betriebswirtschaft)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Eine ausgeprägte Zahlenaffinität und analytische Fähigkeiten&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Erste Berufserfahrung durch Praktika oder Werkstudierendentätigkeiten, idealerweise in einem schnelllebigen Umfeld (z. B. Start-up, Beratung oder FMCG-Branche)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bereitschaft, operative Aufgaben selbst in die Hand zu nehmen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Motivation, von Tag eins an volle Verantwortung für deine Themen zu übernehmen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fließende Sprachkenntnisse in Deutsch und Englisch, um dich in unserem internationalen Umfeld zu verständigen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bereitschaft, vier bis fünf Tage pro Woche in unserem brandneuen Büro in Düsseldorf zu arbeiten&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Darauf kannst du dich freuen&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Starte mit uns durch: Werde Teil unseres internationalen Teams in einem Umfeld, das echtes Wachstum und eine „Act like an Owner“-Mentalität fördert. Treibe Projekte eigenständig voran, teste neue Ideen und profitiere von Trainings, während du den Erfolg unseres Unternehmens direkt mitgestaltest.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Verpflegung: Genieße jeden Tag ein frisches, kostenloses Frühstück und Mittagessen in unserem Büro, dazu gibt es reichlich Snacks und Obst für den Energiekick zwischendurch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unvergessliche Momente: Von unserem legendären jährlichen Ski-Trip über Weihnachtsfeiern bis hin zu Auftritten unserer eigenen Picnic-Band: Wir feiern unsere Erfolge gemeinsam.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ein moderner Workspace: Unser neu renoviertes Büro ist auf Zusammenarbeit ausgelegt und bietet dir flexible Arbeitszeiten sowie 30 Urlaubstage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Individuelle Mobilität: Du entscheidest, wie du zu uns kommst. Wir bieten ein subventioniertes Deutschlandticket und ein „Lease-a-Bike“-Programm an.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wohlbefinden &amp;amp; Gleichgewicht: Wir bieten dir professionelle Unterstützung für deine mentale Gesundheit mit OpenUp. Und dank unseres hundefreundlichen Büros ist dein vierbeiniger Begleiter nach Absprache willkommen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Die Basics: Wir stellen dir alles für deinen Erfolg bereit – inklusive Laptop und Handy sowie Zugang zu exklusiven Rabatten (Corporate Benefits) für Reisen, Technik und vieles mehr.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Nachhaltigkeit als Kern: Werde Teil der Revolution. Du trägst zu einer grüneren Zukunft bei – durch unsere 100 % elektrische Flotte und unsere Lieferkette, die Lebensmittelverschwendung reduziert.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dein Start bei uns&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
