&lt;li&gt;Experience in financial services or another performance-sensitive environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of solving complex infrastructure problems and building shared capabilities other teams can use independently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong track record of maintaining high standards for reliability, documentation, and maintainability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience remaining effective under pressure, with a history of mentoring and knowledge-sharing within teams&lt;/li&gt;
